      <h2>Product leadership, grounded in data</h2>
      <div class="about">
        <p>I've spent six years building and scaling B2C platforms — most recently leading product strategy for a multi-sided logistics and operations platform at eFishery, and before that shipping a fintech product from 0 to 1. My strongest work happens when a business is drowning in operational complexity and needs someone to turn it into a clear, measurable system.</p>
        <p>The two case studies below are the ones I'm proudest of: one shows how I use AI to compress research and build cycles from months to weeks; the other shows how I use data to fix expensive, invisible operational problems.</p>
      </div>
